Moved the REST payload types, the vocabulary names, every REST path, the framework-free helpers, the login components (`LoginCard`, `LoginForm`, `LoginOverlay`, `MagicLinkForm`, `PasswordForm`, `ProviderButton`) and the callback page's card into the new `@plone-collective/identity-core` package, which the add-on now depends on, along with their translations. Nothing changes for a site, but code importing one of them from `@plone-collective/volto-identity/...` now imports it from `@plone-collective/identity-core`. A `razzle.extend.js` resolves the shared package's React to Volto's own. @sneridagh
